        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Britney Spears, Nicole Morier, Selena Gomez, Madonna, Patrick Leonard\n- Songs: \"Rock Me In\", \"Whiplash\", the other Britney Spears and Nicole Morier song, Madonna song inspired by San Pedro Town\n- Places: San Pedro Town\n- Concepts: American pop influence, songwriting, co-production\n\nFacts:\n- Britney Spears and Nicole Morier wrote \"Rock Me In.\"\n- Britney Spears and Nicole Morier wrote \"Whiplash\" for Selena Gomez & the Scene.\n- Britney Spears and Nicole Morier also wrote one other song.\n- That other song has an American pop influence.\n- The American pop influence was described as similar to a Madonna song.\n- San Pedro Town was said to be the inspiration for the Madonna song.\n- Madonna and Patrick Leonard co-wrote and co-produced the Madonna song.",
